msgid "I ain't afraid of no ghost! Particularly not Zoey. Though she may have gotten a bad rep from the other, spookier folks of her kind, Zoey is truly a gentle and goofy little soul. She may be the entity who's lived in the house the longest... and there may or may not be some pretty crazy stories cookin' up in that attic!"
