msgstr ""

#: DateADex/zoey_dex_entry/40
msgctxt "Tag Date-A-Dex"
msgid "Zoey seems to be lonely, and is experiencing a great deal of emotion that she hasn't been able to feel in a long time. You appear to be bringing these feelings out in her, for which she seems both grateful and overwhelmed. She faded away again, but really wants you to come back and see her again."
msgstr ""

#: DateADex/zoey_dex_entry/43
msgctxt "Tag Date-A-Dex"
