#: DateADex/zoey_dex_entry/49
msgctxt "Tag Date-A-Dex"
msgid "Last time you saw her, Zoey had a memory from her past life. She recalled a man named Rudy who once lived in the house with her, and who just might have been a warlock. Suddenly she recalled a little gold necklace with a pink heart pendant on it, and it seemed very important that you bring it to her. She thinks she needs it in order to remember how she died. If you find it, bring it to her."
msgstr ""

